<titlePage type="main"><docTitle><titlePart type="main"><hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#b">Kinder</hi></hi><lb/>
und<lb/>
<hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#b">Hausmärchen</hi></hi></titlePart></docTitle><lb/>
